 "summary": "PNP bipolar transistors in the three-lead SOT-89 surface-mount package; their NPN partners are BCX54, BCX55 and BCX56. BCX51, BCX52 and BCX53 differ in voltage rating (VCEO -45 V, -60 V, -80 V), and each comes ungraded (hFE 63 to 250) or in the gain grades -10 (63 to 160) and -16 (100 to 250). Collector current is rated -1.0 A and dissipation 500 mW.",
